%T A400742 1,1,1,1,6,2,1,4,1,1,1,1,2,1,1,1,1,2,1,1,2,3,1,2,1,2,1,1,4,1,1,1,1,1,
%U A400742 1,1,3,1,1,2,1,1,1,1,2,2,1,3,1,1,1,1,2
%N A400742 Number of runs of at least two odd steps before the first drop of 4n+3 under T(x) = x/2 (x even), (3x+1)/2 (x odd).
%C A400742 The first drop of x is T^j(x) for the least j >= 1 with T^j(x) < x.
%C A400742 Also the number of G-steps from 4n+3 to its first drop: a G-step takes x == 3 (mod 4), x = 2^v*s - 1 with s odd, through its v odd steps to 3^v*s - 1 and on to the next term == 3 (mod 4), or to the first term below 4n+3. All terms of the chain before the last are == 3 (mod 4).
%e A400742 a(6) = 9: 27 -> 31 -> 91 -> 103 -> 175 -> 167 -> 283 -> 319 -> 911 -> 23 (59 steps of T).
%o A400742 (PARI) a(n) = my(b=4*n+3, x=b, c=0, v); until(x<b, v=valuation(x+1, 2); c+=(v>1); x=3^v*((x+1)>>v)-1; x>>=valuation(x, 2)); c;
%Y A400742 Cf. A014682 (T), A060412, A100982, A260590 (dropping time of 2n+1 under T).
%K A400742 nonn
%O A400742 0,7
